# The Virtual Reference Desk: Building Human Expertise into Information Systems.

**Authors:** Lankes, R. David

## Abstract
Presents the Virtual Reference Desk project, its activities, and a proposed information system architecture to build a human intermediated network of expertise and experience. The project seeks to study, support, and improve current K-12 digital reference services, as well as to build a foundation for a national cooperative digital reference service. A preliminary technical architecture is outlined. (Author/AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ575854

